{
 "about": [
   "Model files and ComfyUI node classes of every ai-video workflow, read by the workflow builders (file names) and by preflight.py (what a running ComfyUI must offer).",
   "files: role -> file name as ComfyUI lists it, the models/ sub-folder it lives in and the loader inputs (class.input) that take it.",
   "workflows: what each builder variant needs - node classes, file roles and fixed option values (class.input).",
   "nodes: python module of every node class on the reference ComfyUI (core = 'nodes' / 'comfy_extras.*'; a custom node pack shows as 'custom_nodes.<pack>').",
   "Another machine with other file names: do NOT edit this file - write a JSON override and point the machine config key comfy_models at it (check_tools.py --set comfy_models=<file>, env ANIMATION_STUDIO_COMFY_MODELS), e.g. {\"files\": {\"ltx23\": \"ltx/ltx-2.3-22b-distilled-fp8.safetensors\"}}. Entries are merged key by key."
 ],
